[{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Events <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"D\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are displayed in the Venn diagram below. Write down three different examples of two events that are mutually exclusive.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.54/questions/assets/diagrams/q1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"D\" data-display=\"false\"></span> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"D\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent events. Copy and complete the following Venn diagram.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.54/questions/assets/diagrams/q2.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)=\\mathrm{P}(A)\\times\\mathrm{P}(B)\\Rightarrow0.2=\\mathrm{P}(A)\\times0.6\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{P}(A)=\\frac13\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.54/solutions/assets/diagrams/s2.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are two events such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A)=0.4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(B)=0.55\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cup B)=0.95\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Determine if <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are mutually exclusive.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cup B)=\\mathrm{P}(A)+\\mathrm{P}(B)-\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0.95=0.4+0.55-\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are mutually exclusive events</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are two events such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A)=0.32\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(B)=0.46\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cup B)=0.7\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Determine if <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are mutually exclusive.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cup B)=\\mathrm{P}(A)+\\mathrm{P}(B)-\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0.7=0.32+0.46-\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)=0.08\\ne0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are not mutually exclusive events</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are two events such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A)=\\frac37\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(B)=\\frac23\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)=\\frac27\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Determine if <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent events.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A)\\times\\mathrm{P}(B)=\\frac37\\times\\frac23=\\frac27\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)=\\frac27\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)=\\mathrm{P}(A)\\times\\mathrm{P}(B)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent events</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are two events such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A)=\\frac3{10}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(B)=\\frac56\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Determine if <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent events.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A)\\times\\mathrm{P}(B)=\\frac3{10}\\times\\frac56=\\frac14\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)=\\frac12\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)\\ne\\mathrm{P}(A)\\times\\mathrm{P}(B)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are not independent events</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are two events such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A)=0.45\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(B)=0.52\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)=0.23\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Determine if <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent events.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A)\\times\\mathrm{P}(B)=0.45\\times0.52=0.234\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)=0.23\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)\\ne\\mathrm{P}(A)\\times\\mathrm{P}(B)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are not independent events</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>An estate agent has 30 flats advertised on their website. 16 have an ensuite bathroom, 8 have a balcony, and 6 have both an ensuite bathroom and a balcony. A flat is chosen at random. Determine whether the events `the flat has an ensuite bathroom' and `the flat has a balcony' are independent.</p>","steps":["<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.54/solutions/assets/diagrams/s8.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(\\text{Bathroom})=\\frac{16}{30}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(\\text{Balcony})=\\frac8{30}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(\\text{Bathroom})\\times\\mathrm{P}(\\text{Balcony})=\\frac{16}{30}\\times\\frac8{30}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{32}{225}=0.142\\ldots\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(\\text{Bathroom}\\cap\\text{Balcony})=\\frac6{30}=0.2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(\\text{Bathroom}\\cap\\text{Balcony})\\ne\\mathrm{P}(\\text{Bathroom})\\times\\mathrm{P}(\\text{Balcony})\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are not independent events</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent events such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A)=0.3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cup B)=0.75\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(B)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cup B)=\\mathrm{P}(A)+\\mathrm{P}(B)-\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)=\\mathrm{P}(A)\\times\\mathrm{P}(B)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0.75=0.3+\\mathrm{P}(B)-0.3\\times\\mathrm{P}(B)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0.45=0.7\\mathrm{P}(B)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{P}(B)=\\frac9{14}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent events such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)=0.85\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A)=0.95\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cup B)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)=\\mathrm{P}(A)\\times\\mathrm{P}(B)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0.85=0.95\\times\\mathrm{P}(B)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{P}(B)=\\frac{17}{19}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cup B)=\\mathrm{P}(A)+\\mathrm{P}(B)-\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{P}(A\\cup B)=0.95+\\frac{17}{19}-0.85=\\frac{189}{190}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>Events <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are displayed in the Venn diagram below. Determine if <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent events.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.54/questions/assets/diagrams/q11.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n1 =k+k+\\frac3{20}+\\frac3{10}+\\frac{19}{70}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow1 =2k+\\frac{101}{140}\\Rightarrow k=\\frac{39}{280}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{P}(A) =\\frac{39}{280}+\\frac3{20}+\\frac3{10}=\\frac{33}{56}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{P}(B) =\\frac3{10}+\\frac{19}{70}=\\frac47\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{P}(A)\\times\\mathrm{P}(B) =\\frac{33}{56}\\times\\frac47=\\frac{33}{98}=0.336\\ldots\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B) =\\frac3{10}=0.3\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)\\ne\\mathrm{P}(A)\\times\\mathrm{P}(B)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are not independent events</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>Events <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are displayed in the Venn diagram below. It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent events, and that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are mutually exclusive and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are also mutually exclusive. Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.54/questions/assets/diagrams/q12.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n1 =\\frac{31}{280}+\\frac1{20}+k+k+p\\Rightarrow p=\\frac{47}{56}-2k\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap C) =\\mathrm{P}(A)\\times\\mathrm{P}(C)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow k =\\left(\\frac1{20}+k\\right)(k+p)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow k =\\left(\\frac1{20}+k\\right)\\left(k+\\frac{47}{56}-2k\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow k =\\left(\\frac1{20}+k\\right)\\left(\\frac{47}{56}-k\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow k =\\frac{47}{1120}-\\frac1{20}k+\\frac{47}{56}k-k^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow k^2+\\frac{59}{280}k-\\frac{47}{1120} =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow k =\\frac18\\text{ as }k\\ne-\\frac{47}{140}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\therefore p =\\frac{47}{56}-2\\times\\frac18=\\frac{33}{56}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>Events <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are displayed in the Venn diagram below. It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are mutually exclusive, and that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent. Find the possible values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.54/questions/assets/diagrams/q13.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are mutually exclusive so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n1 =0.24+x+0.2+y+0.2+0.06\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow x+y =0.3\\Rightarrow y=0.3-x\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B) =\\mathrm{P}(A)\\times\\mathrm{P}(B)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow0.2 =(x+0.4)(y+0.2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow0.2 =(x+0.4)(0.3-x+0.2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow0.2 =(x+0.4)(0.5-x)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow0.2 =-x^2+0.5x-0.4x+0.2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow x^2-0.1x =0\\Rightarrow x(x-0.1)=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow x =0.1\\text{ or }x=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0.1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0.3-0.1=0.2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0.3-0=0.3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore x=0.1,\\ y=0.2,\\ z=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0.3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q14","number":14,"question":"<p>Events <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent. It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)=\\frac16\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cup B)=\\frac34\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the possible values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(B)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}((A\\cup B)')=1-\\mathrm{P}(A\\cup B)=1-\\frac34=\\frac14\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.54/solutions/assets/diagrams/s14.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"1=\\frac14+x+\\frac16+y\\Rightarrow y=\\frac7{12}-x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B) =\\mathrm{P}(A)\\times\\mathrm{P}(B)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\frac16 =\\left(x+\\frac16\\right)\\left(\\frac16+y\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\frac16 =\\left(x+\\frac16\\right)\\left(\\frac16+\\frac7{12}-x\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\frac16 =\\left(x+\\frac16\\right)\\left(\\frac34-x\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\frac16 =-x^2+\\frac34x-\\frac16x+\\frac18\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow x^2-\\frac7{12}x+\\frac1{24} =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow x =\\frac1{12}\\text{ or }x=\\frac12\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac1{12}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac7{12}-\\frac1{12}=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac7{12}-\\frac12=\\frac1{12}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\mathrm{P}(A)=\\frac1{12}+\\frac16=\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(B)=\\frac16+\\frac12=\\frac23\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A)=\\frac12+\\frac16=\\frac23\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(B)=\\frac16+\\frac1{12}=\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q15","number":15,"question":"<p>Events <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> have probabilities 0.05, 0.4 and 0.1 respectively.</p><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent events.</p><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are mutually exclusive.</p><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are also mutually exclusive. Draw a fully labelled Venn diagram showing the events <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.54/solutions/assets/diagrams/s15.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q16","number":16,"question":"<p>Events <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> have probabilities 0.05, 0.1 and 0.4 respectively.</p><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent events.</p><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are also independent events.</p><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are mutually exclusive. Draw a fully labelled Venn diagram showing the events <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.54/solutions/assets/diagrams/s16.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q17","number":17,"question":"<p>The two-way table below shows the events <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Determine whether events <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent.</p><div class=\"math-table\"><table><tr><td></td><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A'\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>0.0522</p></td><td><p>0.0928</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B'\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></td><td><p>0.3078</p></td><td><p>0.5472</p></td></tr></table></div>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{P}(A) =0.0522+0.3078=0.36\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{P}(B) =0.0522+0.0928=0.145\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B) =0.0522\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{P}(A)\\times\\mathrm{P}(B) =0.36\\times0.145=0.0522=\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent events.</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q18","number":18,"question":"<p>Three classes, A, B and C in a sixth form college have 75 students, who either study three A-Levels, three A-Levels and one AS-Level, or four A-Levels. The table below shows the number and type of courses the students in each class are studying.</p><div class=\"math-table\"><table><tr><td></td><td><p>Class A</p></td><td><p>Class B</p></td><td><p>Class C</p></td><td><p>Total</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Three A-Levels</p></td><td><p>20</p></td><td><p>14</p></td><td><p>18</p></td><td><p>52</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Three A-Levels + One AS</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>15</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Four A-Levels</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>8</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Total</p></td><td><p>25</p></td><td><p>24</p></td><td><p>26</p></td><td><p>75</p></td></tr></table></div><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is the event `the student is studying three A-Levels'.</p><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is the event `the student is from Class B'.</p><p>A student is selected at random.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(B)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cup B)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B')\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Determine if <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent events.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(B)=\\frac{24}{75}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cup B)=\\mathrm{P}(A)+\\mathrm{P}(B)-\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{52}{75}+\\frac{24}{75}-\\frac{14}{75}=\\frac{62}{75}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B')=\\frac{20+18}{75}=\\frac{38}{75}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A)=\\frac{52}{75},\\ \\mathrm{P}(B)=\\frac{24}{75},\\ \\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)=\\frac{14}{75}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A)\\times\\mathrm{P}(B)=\\frac{52}{75}\\times\\frac{24}{75}=\\frac{416}{1875}\\ne\\frac{14}{75}=\\mathrm{P}(A\\cap B)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are not independent events</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q19","number":19,"question":"<p>Events <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are displayed in the Venn diagram below. Determine whether <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A'\\cap B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.54/questions/assets/diagrams/q19.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{P}(A'\\cap B) =0.12+0.04=0.16\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{P}(C) =0.04+0.1+0.09+0.02=0.25\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{P}((A'\\cap B)\\cap C) =0.04\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathrm{P}(A'\\cap B)\\times\\mathrm{P}(C) =0.16\\times0.25=0.04\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\mathrm{P}((A'\\cap B)\\cap C)\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A'\\cap B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent events</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.54-q20","number":20,"question":"<p>Events <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(A)=0.2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(B)=0.3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}(C)=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent, and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are mutually exclusive. It is also given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are independent and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{P}((A\\cup B\\cup C)')=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.54/solutions/assets/diagrams/s20.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"0.14+0.06+(0.24-0.3k)+0.3k+0.7k=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow0.44+0.7k=1\\Rightarrow k=0.8\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]}]